# Interpretation: the only mismatches are at motion start (phases 1-2, 501-503 ms) and when the robot comes to rest (~300x ms): the IMU reports the last
# velocity step while the recorded ground-truth link velocity is updated only when motion resumes (~400x ms) - most likely gz-sim does not refresh a
# stationary link's velocity component (consistent with TS-027 E1-E3 'after' rows). This is a recorder artefact, not a filter or IMU error.

